00:00:39.456 --> 00:00:41.750
And yes, $100.

00:00:41.750 --> 00:00:42.834
That's right.

00:00:42.834 --> 00:00:45.837
It's based on this book, A $100 Holiday

00:00:46.087 --> 00:00:47.005
